00:24:45.060 --> 00:24:48.780
over the place in
Boston, at AD--

00:24:48.780 --> 00:24:52.860
at MIT, sorry, and just like
in the general Boston/Cambridge

00:24:52.860 --> 00:24:53.360
area.

00:24:53.360 --> 00:24:55.470
We've traveled a long
way for some of them.

00:24:55.470 --> 00:24:58.350
So the dance that you
saw, I think was "Miroh,"

00:24:58.350 --> 00:25:00.060
I think was actually
in Downtown Crossing

00:25:00.060 --> 00:25:02.490
and that was part of our
K-pop in Public series,

00:25:02.490 --> 00:25:05.730
where it's like one
