00:25:09.210 --> 00:25:13.230
in like official big
K-pop dance competitions.

00:25:13.230 --> 00:25:17.010
So I remember we had one where
we filmed at four locations.

00:25:17.010 --> 00:25:20.970
There was like inside a T
stop in Boston, and Downtown

00:25:20.970 --> 00:25:23.070
Crossing, like in
